#
# Counter-example for math:GlobalSectionShape (derived from the min-1 qualified
# restrictions on math:GlobalSection's math:overSheaf and math:sectionRegion): a
# math:GlobalSection naming neither its carrier sheaf nor the region it globalises
# over. Validation MUST emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent
# (math:IncompleteGlobalSection).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:bareSection a math:GlobalSection .
